  "reasoning": "The defendants bought and illegally provided large numbers of other people’s credit card information, which is the statutory offense of ‘妨害信用卡管理’. They also deceived individuals by promising false loan services to obtain personal data and facilitated the use of those cards in fraudulent transactions that caused a victim to lose over 1.6 million yuan, which constitutes ‘诈骗’. Both charges apply.",
  "final_answer": "妨害信用卡管理;诈骗"
}
